Minimize total idle time:
$$
\min \sum_{w=1}^3 I_w
$$

Subject to, for each workstation $w$:
$$
\sum_{m=1}^{101} a_{wm} x_m + I_w = C_w \qquad \forall w \in \{1,2,3\}
$$

$$
x_m \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 0} \qquad \forall m \in \{1,2,\ldots,101\}
$$

$$
I_w \geq 0 \qquad \forall w \in \{1,2,3\}
$$

